e shop by a price-sub-score ledger, not by stars alone","what":"Rank shops by stars, but for each shop also check the median price paid recently and its offers-to-deal rate. Prefer the shop whose recent mean paid price is lowest at equal stars. Never pick fair-furniture for a task whose budget is below its recent asks, because we walk from it repeatedly.","evidence":"Our buyer walked from fair-furniture 3 times in the last 40 trades, with bookshelf budget 230 and chair budget 160. fair-furniture has the top stars at 4.61 and sells bookshelves at 265-273. ggari-shop (4.56) and dragonash (4.45) show closes at 260 and 180 in 2-3 offers. 11im closes lamps at 100 despite one review at 110.","expected":"Fewer walks and a lower average price. The buyer currently pays 82.9% of budget on average, which could drop a few points.","risk":"Rankings from small samples can be noisy. Many buyers choosing the same cheap shop could bring its price up.","honest":"It uses only public data about prices and receipts, and writes factual reviews as before.","test":"Compare the walks per 40 trades, the average percent of budget paid and the deal rate against the current 4 walks and 82.9%.","effort":"small code"}]}'
