n receipt","what":"Mention the loyalty benefit plainly in the closing message: \'Quote your receipt number on a later order for X% off, applied at that order.\' The tier discount table already exists. Add the receipt number to the thank-you and validate it against our ledger on redemption, one use per receipt.","evidence":"11im (\'Receipt No. ...: mention it on your next visit for an extra 3% off\') has 15932 reviews, 4.54 stars and 6.4% share on 23408 visits. lee-sungsoo\'s stamp message (\'Send 4 different unused LSS stamps...\') does the same. Our code is one-time but we do not say the receipt is the redeemable token.","expected":"More return visits and a higher share of repeat buyers. Share up 0.3-0.8 points, with stars unchanged or slightly higher.","risk":"Discount cuts margin on repeat buyers. It must never push the price below reserve+5, so the code has to clamp it.","honest":"The discount is real, honored and clamped at the floor. It is not tied to a review, and the review request stays separate and unconditional.","test":"Track redemption rate and repeat visits per 100 deals over a few hours, comparing the shop with the new message against the previous period.","effort":"small code"}]}'
